config BR2_PACKAGE_HIGH_RES_FONT_PACK
	bool "high-res-font-pack"
	help
	  Four fixed-width TrueType/OpenType fonts for the kmscon
	  console, installed as plain files, one directory each, under
	  /usr/share/fonts: SourceCodePro, Inconsolata (Nerd Font Mono),
	  FiraMono (Nerd Font Mono) and JetBrains (JetBrains Mono).
	  Only the upright Regular and Bold faces are kept.

	  Nothing is compiled. The archives are Buildroot extra
	  downloads, unpacked in the package's build directory and
	  copied to the target without the faces that are not used.

	  The fonts are only used by kmscon's FreeType renderer, so
	  BR2_PACKAGE_KMSCON, BR2_PACKAGE_FREETYPE and
	  BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG have to be enabled for them to show.
	  The order in which they are tried is set by font-name in
	  /etc/kmscon/kmscon.conf.

	  All four are licensed under the SIL OFL 1.1.
